msgstr "**図3。** SCM・TCM 空間の自由エネルギー表面（LJ 単位）。橙の星は局所極小 Isomer です。"

#: README.md:438
msgid ""
"Note that theere is bias added around all the states, that means that the "
"system jumped from one state to the others and gave a complete "
"reconstruction of the free energy surface."
msgstr "すべての状態に Bias が加わり、系が状態間を移動して FES を全体的に再構成したことがわかります。"

#: README.md:442
msgid "Restart Note"
msgstr "再開の注意"

